  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Better Regulation Delivery Office (BRDO) inspection portal</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Inspection Portal Web Service Pilot Module is being developed by BRDO, assigned by the Netherlands Enterprise Agency (RVO) and the Netherlands embassy in Kyiv, Ukraine. This online service, aimed at assisting entrepreneurs in navigating business inspection rules and procedures, also acts as a prototype risk-management tool for entrepreneurs and regulators. It facilitates and enhances the interaction between business owners and state inspection authorities.When the Inspection Portal Web Service Module is implemented, businesses and entrepreneurs can look into scheduled inspections, have access to the inspection results of all inspections that are performed (each inspection result is searchable, viewable, and downloadable by users), look into all identified violations by the inspection authorities and they can register and see all deadlines for inspection measures that apply to their specific business. In this way, the Inspection Portal Web Service Pilot Module will contribute to a more transparent legal framework for entrepreneurs and investors, create incentives for entrepreneurs and investors to operate legally and encourage potential entrepreneurs or investors to enter new markets.</narrative>
  </description>
